    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if it's just burnout though. burnout feels like being tired. this feels more like... being an error code. like i'm just a bug in the code that the universe forgot to patch. i look at people in the street and they look so \"rendered\" and solid, and i just feel like a transparent layer or a flickering texture. it feels like it would be so much cleaner if i just... wasn't part of the stream anymore. like if the glitch just stopped.",
      "source": "evaluator"
